lox add locksql: one database, applied at once (Ctrl-C before the review: nothing is kept)

Engine: postgres, mysql, mariadb or sqlite (required) [postgres]: 
Host (required) [host.docker.internal]: 
Port (required) [5432]: 
User (optional: empty = the console asks for it at start with the password): 
Database (optional: empty = the server's default database): 
Production? (each approval needs the profile name typed) [y/N] 
TLS: disable, prefer, require, verify-ca or verify-full (required) [disable]: 
Credentials: ask (typed, masked, at the console's start) or vault (required) [ask]: vault
Vault path (required) [database/creds/db-2]: 
Name (required) [db-2]: 
